                2
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-2">Site Preparation</h3>
                <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
                  Proper preparation is key. We inspect and prepare the subfloor to ensure it is
                  clean, level, and structurally sound, creating a solid foundation for your tile.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-6">
              <div
                class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg"
