                3
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-2">Layout & Planning</h3>
                <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
                  Before installation begins, we carefully plan the tile layout to ensure balanced
                  spacing, clean lines, and optimal visual appeal.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-6">
              <div
                class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg"
              >
                4
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-2">Professional Installation</h3>
                <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
                  Using industry-best techniques and materials, our skilled installers place each
                  tile with precision, ensuring consistent spacing and alignment.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-6">
              <div
                class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg"
              >
                5
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-2">Grouting & Finishing</h3>
                <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
                  Once tiles are set, grout is applied to secure and seal the floor. We finish with
                  detailed cleanup and final inspection to ensure every detail meets our quality
                  standards.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-6">
              <div
                class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg"
              >
                6
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-2">Final Walkthrough</h3>
                <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
                  We review the completed floor with you, answer care questions, and make sure
                  you're fully satisfied with the result.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-4 text-center">
            Tile Beyond the Floor
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <figure>
              <Image
                src="/images/tile-arabesque-backsplash-gas-cooktop.jpg"
